#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Adrovaedje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Welcome to &kate;, a programmer's text editor for &kde; version 4 and above. "
"Some of &kate;'s many features include configurable syntax highlighting for "
"languages ranging from C and C++ to &HTML; to bash scripts, the ability to "
"create and maintain projects, a multiple document interface (<acronym>MDI</"
"acronym>), and a self-contained terminal emulator."
msgstr ""
"Bénvnowe a &kate;, èn aspougneu d' tecse po les programeus pol &kde; modêye "
"2.2 et å dzeu. Emey les fonccionålités di &kate; i gn a èn apontiåve "
"metaedje en evidince sorlon li sintacse, po des lingaedjes di programaedje "
"come li C eyet C++ mins ossu l' <acronym>HTML</acronym>, les scripes shell; "
"li possibilité d' askepyî eyet manaedjî des pordjets; ene eterface a "
"documints multipes (<acronym>MDI</acronym>); eyet on ravalé terminå."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"But &kate; is more than a programmer's editor. Its ability to open several "
"files at once makes it ideal for editing &UNIX;'s many configuration files. "
"This document was written in &kate;."
msgstr ""
"Mins &kate; est pus k' ene usteye po les programeus. Ci possibilité d' drovi "
"sacwants fitchîs e minme tins endè fwait èn aspougneu d' tecse a l' idêye po "
"candjî les fitchîs d' apontiaedje k' end a télmint so on sistinme &UNIX;. Ci "
"documint chal a stî scrît avou &kate;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing this manual..."
msgstr "Candjant ci live ci..."

